# D&D 5e 2024 — Official Sources and Expansions

Apply when session `edition` is **2024**. Follow `character-creator-research.mdc`; link the specific book for every option.

## Session source selection (ask before step 1)

After edition is confirmed, ask which **official sources** are allowed. Never enable a book silently.

1. **Core only** — 2024 PHB (+ DMG/MM only if DM approves bastions, crafting, companions).
2. **Core + Expanded** — PHB plus official Wizards supplements (tables below).
3. **Core + Expanded + 2014 carryover** — supplements plus 2014-only options not reprinted in 2024.
4. **Custom list** — player/DM names specific books; **Other / custom (describe)**.

Record in JSON `constraints.sourceTier` and `contentSources`. Tag every option with its source in chat and `character.md`.

## Replacement rules (2024 over 2014)

When the same option exists in 2024 PHB and an older book, **use the 2024 version**.

- Source: [Updates in PHB 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/posts/1810-updates-in-the-players-handbook-2024)

**2014-only carryover** (still valid in 2024 games — cite 2014 source):

| Type | Options |
|------|---------|
| Cleric domains | Knowledge, Nature, Tempest |
| Wizard schools | Conjuration, Enchantment, Necromancy, Transmutation |
| Species | Half-Elf, Half-Orc |
| Feats | Dungeon Delver, Linguist, Martial Adept |
| Class | **Artificer** (Eberron / TCoE — no 2024 PHB version) |

**Legacy adaptation:** PHB 2024 sidebar for using 2014 backgrounds/species — ask player before applying; cite [Creating a Character](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/phb-2024/creating-a-character).

## 2024 Core Rulebooks

| Book | D&D Beyond | PC options |
|------|------------|------------|
| Player's Handbook (2024) | [PHB 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/phb-2024) | 12 classes, 48 subclasses, 10 species, 16 backgrounds, 75 feats, spells, weapon masteries |
| Dungeon Master's Guide (2024) | [DMG 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/dmg-2024) | Bastions, crafting — DM approval required |
| Monster Manual (2024) | [MM 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/mm-2024) | Companion/beast stat blocks for class features |

D&D Beyond may label 2024 rules **5.5e** — treat as `edition: "2024"`.

