## Presenting expanded options

- List options **only from allowed sources**.
- Tag in chat and `character.md`: `[PHB24]`, `[MotM]`, `[XGtE]`, etc.
- **Origin feats:** must be Origin-type (2024 PHB). Expanded-book feats apply at appropriate General/Epic levels unless DM rules otherwise.
- **Subclasses from expanded books** that were reprinted in 2024 PHB (e.g. Gloom Stalker, Celestial Patron, Psi Warrior) — use 2024 PHB version.

